  "description": "***Promotional oneshot for the novel.***\n\nOne day I was in a world that I did not know.  \n[The introduction to the quest has been successfully completed! ].\n\n[Quest (Main) - «Fix the world!».   \nContent: This world was created by mixing four novels: Child Care, Contract Marriage, XXX, XXX. Genres are unknown. You must return the four distorted novels to the original. ].\n\nBut... I have no memory of their content. If I make a mistake... then I’m going to die?! Besides, the distorted web novel characters are interested in me! What should I do?!\n\n[Original Novel](https://page.kakao.com/home/%EB%A1%9C%ED%8C%90%EC%9D%84-%EB%AA%A8%EB%A5%B4%EB%A9%B4-%EC%A3%BD%EC%8A%B5%EB%8B%88%EB%8B%A4/57460343)  \nPromotional Webtoon (Twitter)\n\n*•The promo was released on a Twitter Thread.  \n•Promo & 1st Cover Illustration is by Sadam  \n•2nd Cover Illustration is by Passerby*",
